 "text": "Tailtiu is an Irish land goddess. She stood between two groups of invaders. One group was the Fir Bolg. The other was the Tuatha De Danan. She may have been a member of the Fir Bolg. She was also named a Spanish princess. She married Eochaid mac Eirc, the last Fir Bolg king. He fell at the first battle of Mag Tuired. Tailtiu then cleared fields on the island. The work killed her. She asked that her funeral hold horse racing and games forever. Her foster son, the god Lugh, built the festival that bears his name. The festival is Lughnasa.",
